flowchart TD
    A[Source Registry V2] --> B[Acquire RAW bytes]
    B --> C[SHA256 + provenance]
    C --> D[Content Hygiene]
    D --> D1[AD / BANNER]
    D --> D2[SCRIPT / STYLE]
    D --> D3[NAVIGATION]
    D --> D4[CANDIDATE DATA]
    D4 --> E[Source-specific parser]
    E --> F[Universal FULL_27 validator]
    F --> G{Calendar state}
    G -->|NON_DRAW_DAY| X[Closure evidence]
    G -->|UNKNOWN_GAP| Y[HOLD / DENY]
    G -->|DRAW_EXPECTED| H[Source identity]
    H --> I{Quorum >= 2 independent?}
    I -->|NO| Y
    I -->|CONFLICT| J[Conflict Ledger]
    J --> Y
    I -->|YES| K[Cross-source agreement]
    K --> L[Project_Brain governance]
    L -->|DENY| Y
    L -->|PASS| M[CANDIDATE EVIDENCE]
    M --> N[Derive TAIL_27]
    N --> O[Legacy Excel reconciliation]
    O -->|Mismatch| J
    O -->|Match| P[Evidence complete]
    P --> Q[Promotion remains separate]
    R[Legacy Excel] --> O
    S[Project_Brain_AI] -.governs.-> L
    T[app.py UI] -.presentation only.-> U[New Core]
